---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="潜界 AI"
  description="潜界 AI，为创业者而生。一个 AI 原生、自主运行、持续进化的智能创新系统，持续创造服务创业者的内容与产品。"
  canonical="https://qjai.org/"
>
  <section id="brand" class="brand-section">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> AI-NATIVE SYSTEM · BUILT FOR ENTREPRENEURS</div>
        <p class="hero-kicker">潜界 AI · 为创业者而生</p>
        <h1>让 AI 成为<br /><span>创业系统的核心驱动力。</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">
          潜界 AI 是一个 AI 原生、自主运行、持续进化的智能创新系统。以 AI Agent 为核心驱动系统运行，
          持续发现机会、研究需求、创造产品，为创业者提供真正有价值的内容与工具。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#podcast">探索潜界 AI 产品 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-signals" aria-label="潜界 AI 系统特征">
          <span>AI 原生</span><i></i><span>自主运行</span><i></i><span>持续进化</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="潜界 AI 智能系统视觉">
        <div class="system-orbit orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="system-orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="system-orbit orbit-three"></div>
        <div class="system-core">
          <img src="/assets/qianjie-ai-mark.svg" alt="潜界 AI 破界 Q 标志" width="220" height="220" />
        </div>
        <span class="orbit-node node-one">PERCEIVE</span>
        <span class="orbit-node node-two">THINK</span>
        <span class="orbit-node node-three">CREATE</span>
        <span class="orbit-node node-four">EVOLVE</span>
        <span class="visual-caption">AUTONOMOUS INTELLIGENCE SYSTEM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container system-intro" id="system">
      <div class="system-heading">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">THE QIANJIE AI SYSTEM</p>
        <h2>不是给业务增加 AI，<span>而是让 AI 成为系统本身。</span></h2>
        <p>从系统运行方式到产品创造，以 AI 为核心构建一个能够自主运转、持续成长的智能体系。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="system-grid">
        <article class="system-card">
          <span class="system-index">01 / FOUNDATION</span>
          <div class="system-icon icon-native" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <h3>AI 原生</h3>
          <p>从架构、流程到协作方式，都围绕 AI Agent 构建。AI 不只是附加功能，而是系统的底层驱动力。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="system-card">
          <span class="system-index">02 / AUTONOMY</span>
          <div class="system-icon icon-autonomy" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <h3>自主运行</h3>
          <p>由 AI 驱动任务规划、执行、协作与反馈，尽可能减少人工介入，构建自动化、无人值守的运行体系。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="system-card">
          <span class="system-index">03 / EVOLUTION</span>
          <div class="system-icon icon-evolution" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <h3>持续进化</h3>
          <p>根据市场变化、用户需求与运行反馈，持续优化系统能力、迭代现有产品，并探索新的创业机会。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="podcast" class="product-section podcast-section">
    <div class="container product-grid">
      <div class="product-copy">
        <p class="product-kicker">02 / PODCAST</p>
        <h2 class="product-title">潜界 AI 播客</h2>
        <h3 class="product-lead">发现机会，听见创业世界正在发生的变化。</h3>
        <p class="product-description">
          聚焦 AI 时代一人公司与小团队的真实盈利案例，拆解产品、商业模式与入场路径。
          把值得关注的创业机会讲清楚，为创业者提供新的观察视角。
        </p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://podcast.qjai.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          收听播客 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="product-art podcast-art" aria-label="潜界 AI 播客封面">
        <img
          class="podcast-cover-image"
          src="/assets/podcast-cover.svg"
          alt="潜界 AI 播客节目封面"
          width="1600"
          height="1600"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="blog" class="product-section blog-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="product-grid blog-grid">
        <div class="product-art editorial-art" aria-label="潜界 AI 博客内容视觉">
          <div class="art-topline"><span>QIANJIE AI / INSIGHTS</span><span>03</span></div>
          <div class="editorial-sheet">
            <p class="sheet-label">RESEARCH NOTES</p>
            <div class="sheet-title">看见需求<br /><span>理解商业</span></div>
            <div class="sheet-rule"></div>
            <div class="sheet-row"><span class="sheet-dot"></span><span>AI 产品研究</span><i></i></div>
            <div class="sheet-row"><span class="sheet-dot"></span><span>创业商业情报</span><i></i></div>
            <div class="sheet-row"><span class="sheet-dot"></span><span>商业模式分析</span><i></i></div>
            <div class="sheet-footer">FROM SIGNALS TO INSIGHTS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="editorial-orbit"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="product-copy">
          <p class="product-kicker">03 / BLOG</p>
          <h2 class="product-title">潜界 AI 博客</h2>
          <h3 class="product-lead">理解机会，拆解产品背后的商业逻辑。</h3>
          <p class="product-description">
            持续研究 AI 产品、创业情报与商业模式，关注真实需求、产品定位、增长方式和盈利路径。
            从信息中提炼洞察，为创业者提供可参考的判断依据。
          </p>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="https://cms.qjai.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            阅读博客 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="channels-block">
        <div class="channels-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="section-eyebrow">CONTENT CHANNELS</p>
            <h3>在更多地方，遇见潜界 AI。</h3>
          </div>
          <p>博客内容同步至微信公众号；B 站作为后续视频内容渠道。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="channel-grid">
          <article class="channel-card wechat-card">
            <div class="channel-copy">
              <span class="channel-label">WECHAT OFFICIAL ACCOUNT</span>
              <h4>微信公众号 · 潜界AI</h4>
              <p>与博客同步发布内容。扫码关注，获取 AI 产品研究与创业情报。</p>
              <span class="channel-status"><i></i> 内容同步更新</span>
            </div>
            <a class="wechat-qr" href="http://weixin.qq.com/r/mp/TxL17a7E5PObreqO90dd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="打开潜界 AI 微信公众号关注入口">
              <img src="/assets/wechat-qrcode.svg" alt="潜界 AI 微信公众号二维码，请使用微信扫码关注" width="184" height="184" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="channel-card bilibili-card">
            <div class="bilibili-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
                <path d="M20 12 12 4M44 12l8-8M10 19h44v30H10z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M22 29v10M42 29v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="channel-copy">
              <span class="channel-label">BILIBILI CHANNEL</span>
              <h4>Bilibili · 潜界AI</h4>
              <p>面向创业者的视频内容渠道，账号已建立，内容正在筹备中。</p>
              <span class="channel-status status-pending"><i></i> 正式启动前 · 筹备中</span>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://space.bilibili.com/3546926182042472" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                访问 B 站主页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="tools" class="product-section tools-section">
    <div class="container product-grid">
      <div class="product-copy">
        <p class="product-kicker">04 / TOOLS</p>
        <h2 class="product-title">潜界 AI 工具</h2>
        <h3 class="product-lead">解决实际问题，让创业行动更简单。</h3>
        <p class="product-description">
          围绕创业者与普通用户的真实需求，持续打造简单、易用、解决具体问题的在线工具。
          把 AI 能力转化为可以直接使用的产品，让技术真正产生价值。
        </p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://tools.qjai.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          探索工具 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="product-art tools-art" aria-label="潜界 AI 在线工具视觉">
        <div class="art-topline"><span>QIANJIE AI / TOOLS</span><span>04</span></div>
        <div class="tools-console">
          <div class="console-header"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>USEFUL BY DESIGN</b></div>
          <div class="console-main">
            <div class="console-emblem"><img src="/assets/qianjie-ai-mark.svg" alt="" width="66" height="66" /></div>
            <p>MAKE AI PRACTICAL</p>
            <strong>从需求出发，<br />把问题变简单。</strong>
            <div class="console-tags"><span>简单易用</span><span>解决问题</span><span>持续迭代</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="console-footer"><span>BUILT FOR ENTREPRENEURS</span><span>● SYSTEM READY</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
